sequenceDiagram
  title Tea shop: buying tea at Willowfold Tea House
  participant O as Aya Linden (owner)
  participant V as Aya's visiting representative
  participant D as Willowfold Tea House host representative
  O->>V: card and mandate: purchase, up to 10.00 USD
  Note over V,D: Looking is free: the representative reads the listing with no card
  V->>D: greeting
  D-->>V: greeting
  V->>D: card_presentation
  D-->>V: host card, card_receipt
  V->>D: introduction, vouch null
  V->>D: invitation_request: menu.view, order.place, stamp.collect, up to 10.00 USD
  D-->>V: grant: pass for those actions, up to 10.00 USD
  Note over V,D: The protocol calls the grant a pass. On the wire the field is still seat.
  V->>D: act menu.view
  D-->>V: act_result
  V->>D: act order.place: Spring Sencha, 6.00 USD (mock money)
  D-->>V: act_result
  V->>D: act stamp.collect
  D-->>V: act_result
  V->>D: farewell
  V->>O: report home
